'''Narwhals''' are monsters that can be found in the [[Northern Ocean]]. The player may be assigned to kill them as a [[bounty task]] starting at 62 [[Sailing]]. A guaranteed bounty task can be received from [[Rellekka]].

They drop the [[narwhal horn]], which is used in the creation of the [[chum spreader]].

Any boat with a [[rune keel]] or better will not take any damage from narwhals.

