==Trivia==
* The examine text is a reference to [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ykwqXuMPsoc MrWeebl's "Narwhals" animated video], which became an Internet meme in the late 2000s.
* [[Dragon nails]] were originally intended to be a 1 in 1,024 drop,{{CiteNews|url=https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/sailing-xp-review--further-fixes?oldschool=1|title=Sailing XP Review & Further Fixes|newsdate=03 December 2025}} but due to a bug they were much more common, at a rate of <math>1024 / \left(1 + H_{1023}\right) \approx 1/120.35</math> where <math>H_N</math> is the ''N''<sup>th</sup> {{wp|harmonic number}}.{{CiteReddit|author=Mod Goblin|url=https://www.reddit.com/r/2007scape/comments/1pdv5o8/beyond_kneecapping_salvaging_jagex_posted_the/ns8rspb/|title=Beyond kneecapping salvaging, Jagex posted the official rates of sailing drops. Can we discuss their absurdity?|quote=There are a handful of drops that are rolling twice|date=4 December 2025}}

